000700**************************************************************
000800**                                                          **
000900**   T R E Q P R P T - OPEN REQUISITIONS IN PURCHASING      **
001000**                                                          **
001100**   THIS REPORT GIVES A LISTING OF ALL REQUISITIONS OPEN   **
001200**   IN PURCHASING. A REQUISITION IS CONSIDERED OPEN IN     **
001300**   PURCHASING IF IT HAS BEEN RELEASED TO PURCHASING BY    **
001400**   THE ORIGINATOR AND HAS NOT BEEN ASSIGNED TO A          **
001500**   PURCHASE ORDER.  THE REPORT IS SORTED BY BUYER CODE    **
001600**   AND WITHIN BUYER CODE SORTED BY REQUISITION NUMBER.    **
001700**                                                          **
001800**     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 46                             **
001900**     REPORT HEADER       - HDR46.PUB                      **
002000**     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - FREQPRPT                     **
002100**     BR3 ON THE BUYERS MENU (UDCBUYER.PUB)                **
002200**                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      *C                                                           *
      *C  SEPT 05, 1996    CA YODER                                *
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.          *
      *C                                                           *
      *C   NOVEMBER 4, 1997   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER ROUTINE - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   DEC 23, 1998    CA YODER
      *C     CORRECTED PAGE BREAK LOGIC WHEN BREAK IS BY PLANT
      *C     CODE.  THE BUYER NAME IN THE HEADING WAS NOT SHOWING
      *C     THE CORRECT NAME.
      *C
